WEBVTT

00:00:28.916 --> 00:00:32.036
And the waiter had just delivered,
you know, champagne,

00:00:32.076 --> 00:00:34.716
put two glasses in front of us
and we were toasting.

00:00:34.756 --> 00:00:36.196
We put the glasses down,

00:00:36.236 --> 00:00:38.036
and I started to tell Walter,

00:00:38.076 --> 00:00:42.876
I, although excited, and it was a hard
won process to get there.

00:00:42.916 --> 00:00:44.796
It's almost a year and a half process,

00:00:44.796 --> 00:00:47.396
in addition to all of the other
years of getting there.

00:00:47.436 --> 00:00:50.796
To make partner, you have to audition
and there's lots of steps to it.

00:00:51.076 --> 00:00:53.556
I was really excited,
but I was also really nervous.

00:00:53.596 --> 00:00:54.916
I felt all eyes were on me,

00:00:54.916 --> 00:00:57.996
I felt like what I did next would really,
not only reflect on me

00:00:57.996 --> 00:01:00.956
but would reflect on other
women of color around me.